<title>USA: Barrick opens Meikle mine.</title>
<headline>Barrick opens Meikle mine.</headline>
<dateline>ELKO, Nevada 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrick Gold Corp said on Friday that its Meikle Mine in Nevada will officially open on Saturday.</p>
<p>The US$180 million mine is scheduled to produce more than 400,000 ounces of gold a year, making it the largest underground producer in the United States, Barrick said in a statement.</p>
<p>Meikle, in the middle of the Carlin Trend in northern Nevada, has gold reserves of 6.6 million ounces, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
